 "decimation": "capped at rel_frame<=100; rel<50 (streak+swell) every 2nd source frame, rel 50..100 (warning->settle) every 3rd. After rel~100 the wave is settled (~= wave_seq.bin frame0) so the web hands off to the wave_seq loop.",
