  "warning_settle": "rel_frame ~63..90: epilepsy warning full-bright overlays; wave dims behind it then settles.",
  "settled": "rel_frame >90: steady ribbon (ndcY span ~0.8, full settled geometry = matches wave_seq.bin frame0 region)."
